Tool response:
Tool: search_boards
Description: Search boards by the provided keyword in the board name or description and return matching board IDs and names.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "keyword": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Keyword to search in board names or descriptions",
          "title": "Keyword"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "keyword"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: find_board_posts
Description: Filter posts within a specified board by status, segment, and category, then sort by creation date descending and return post details.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "board_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "ID of the board to query",
          "title": "Board Id"
        },
        "status": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "Status name to filter posts by (e.g., 'Planned', 'In Progress')",
          "title": "Status"
        },
        "segment": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "Segment name to filter posts by (e.g., 'Enterprise')",
          "title": "Segment"
        },
        "category": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "Category name to filter posts by (e.g., 'Integrations')",
          "title": "Category"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "board_id"
      ]
    }
